{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18715","headline":"浑鸿胪宅闻歌效白紵 · 柳宗元","name":"浑鸿胪宅闻歌效白紵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠帷双卷出倾城，龙劒破匣霜月明。\n朱唇掩仰悄无声，金簧玉磬宫中生。\n下沈秋火激太清，天高地逈凝日晶，羽觞荡漾何事倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}